{
  "day": 5,
  "beats": {
    "boot": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Still raining. Same as yesterday, same as the day before."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A new hire's proposal in the group. Fifty likes.",
          "where": "screen:msgs:group"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Good to see young people with ideas. The boss said so.",
          "where": "screen:msgs:boss"
        }
      ]
    },
    "desk": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The work is done. You push the chair back a little. Your palms are damp."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The gap between the two screens is a little wider than this afternoon."
        }
      ]
    },
    "shutdown": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The light goes out. You did not turn it off."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A hand comes out of the gap. Thin, long knuckles, palm up."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "The first time."
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hold up the chick.",
          "effects": {
            "item_dream": "chick",
            "san": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Hand over the 44,000 line of the ledger.",
          "effects": {
            "item_lost": "loan"
          },
          "cond_show": {
            "has": "lent"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Give it nothing.",
          "effects": {
            "san": -1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "night": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You close your eyes. First a grey-white behind the lids, then, bit by bit, a room. Not this one."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The tail end of summer; the fan chops the light into bright and dark. First week of school, second lesson, test papers handed back.",
          "backdrop": "/room/dream/classroom.jpg"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Ninety-six. Since first grade you had never scored under a hundred. In that very second it chirped in your desk drawer.",
          "prop": "/room/props/exam_96.png"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The whole class heard it. Nobody turned round. Neither did you."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "teacher",
          "t": "Toys rot the mind."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "On the last day of term she handed it back with your report card. The report first: a hundred. Then it, its screen already the grave.",
          "prop": "/room/props/exam_100.png"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "teacher",
          "t": "She was right to take it."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It was taken. I did not stop feeding it."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today is over."
        }
      ]
    },
    "box": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today's little box is heavier. A cassette and a walkman. The box's corners worn round."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The walkman is heavier than you remember; the battery bay bulges a little."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
